The vendored file is based on ps5-payload-dev/sdk libc/emutls.c:
https://github.com/ps5-payload-dev/sdk/blob/13ccc2d5bf2ac396cdf5007c2b72493cb3d5c8bb/libc/emutls.c
Original SHA-256: 86813748aa5668112a0a5891601f5ae36660294a749a013fef7c3bbbd805737c

Switchfin changes EMUTLS_SKIP_DESTRUCTOR_ROUNDS from zero to one for the
non-Bionic path. This retains emulated thread-local storage during libc++abi's
pthread-key fallback for C++ thread-local destructors. The original SDK support
object is not linked alongside the replacement.
